<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that Energy Group Plc, Huntingdon Life and Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA SA were unavailable for trading.</p>
<p>Unavailable for news were Revlon Inc, 99 Cent Only, Fedders, Fedders A, Fedders preferred, Birmingham Steel and Big Flower Press Holdings.</p>
